flowchart LR
  A["Multiple resident Shepherds admit and perform useful work"] --> N["Confirmed IMDSv2 Spot notice plus real deadline"]
  N --> C["Recompute notice and outer budgets; bounded TERM then KILL child"]
  X["Normal validation command exits"] --> W["Request idle watcher stop; wait for accepted transaction terminal state"]
  W --> C
  C --> P["ACTIVE to SUSPENDED to DORMANT; capture every existing CSM capsule"]
  P --> G["Signed live_kernel subrecord: Runtime-v2 manifest + exact capsule and model bindings"]
  G --> V["Dedicated retained Runtime volume"]
  V --> R["Replacement host validates lineage and population"]
  R --> H["Restore exact CSM capsule set; create and validate actual Runtime-v2 rehydration report"]
  H --> O["Prepare complete receipt; atomically open global admission; then clear local stops"]
  O --> T["Only now run deterministic warm continuation per resident"]
  S["Operator observes and controls admission, lifecycle, checkpoint, restore and task status"] --> C
  S --> R
  T --> S
  P -->|"partial, duplicate, deadline"| F["Fail closed"]
  F --> B["Preserve closed admission and every stop intent; emit no readiness"]
  R -->|"missing, tampered, rollback, substituted"| F
